# Sound branch (#349, D80): the branch skin of a one-way Platform, native 32x16. Joins a trunk on its left edge: its root
# (columns 0-2) swells by a row up and down into a dark bark collar that lies over the trunk's bark (D122);
# perch-left is the same branch on the left of a trunk. Active tier (D76): ink contour, living bark, a pale walkable
# top line (the log's "stand here" line) and a green leaf tuft. No crack, no grey: those mean a rotten branch.
size 32 16
color k 0b0814
color W 4a2e1c
color w 8a5a30
color l c08a4c
color g 2f5a2c
color G 5f8f3a
color J 4a2e1c
frame perch
